From 532607859b4e2e9ffe9bbc5a4dbc708e9bcda42e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominic Murphy <ddmurphy@bu.edu>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:28:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(oauth2): Add external JWT exchange path

Validate external JWTs against trusted IdPs and prepare mapping-based
token issuance with assertion-expiry caps.

Fail closed until assertion replay protection is wired.

Signed-off-by: Dominic Murphy <ddmurphy@bu.edu>
