From 63ae4b219e72626eb20ddc55ef3fe0a904e93f1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominic Murphy <ddmurphy@bu.edu>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:32:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(oauth2): Add external assertion handler

Verify external JWTs using trusted IdP keys and the shared profile.
Prepare mapped token claims with assertion-expiry caps; fail closed
until replay protection is available.

Signed-off-by: Dominic Murphy <ddmurphy@bu.edu>
